{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9851f4cf72f0df3ec193ecb27a53fe69a3597a064baf82f5d0a88cd8785a079a",
      "text": "That day. Something like an angel\ndescended from the sky and burned\nour city down.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:69af392bef3476af580022348612117a6188cca9ca45d2fa6677a765d967720a",
      "text": "But the seniors...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d098996ab0fd7ef0538e5024a149349803766ce57f55c2bd990be0cecd856cca",
      "text": "...No. Everyone didn't lose.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "17": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:abf00b5380a3d0874bee9664dd79b0517498d78dc2c0ed150afb0f58a00194fe",
      "text": "Big Bro... I'm fighting too. So I\nwon't cry anymore.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "20": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:abe61e830121b3269640a04e47ba7632dba3aff07a38cd2eff065ee8d9aa4f1d",
      "text": "Instead, next time we meet, I'm\ngoing to slap you, so get ready...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "24": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5489b0ef5a0c74d7ed290f108c9cbad39bb2cb1fa62ba952bf045a3d4809ebb0",
      "text": "I'll grab the stars...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "28": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:abb9e9d3b059ce26e38cab432f80f99bad5e59f8f5430bbb00d60ab6d9c64698",
      "text": "Build... a ship?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "33": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8edc219af6b7879d8d390d98c86b10f4c7ea0aea4e6f2aa291127e7a334f0cda",
      "text": "Yes. This time, we'll go help Ayumu\nand the others. We need it for\nthat.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "38": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fd668288da3842cbde2afb59935c62a8eb95d54ebc8478c7b37fa5358400a423",
      "text": "A warship run on tech from many worlds\nplus a dragon's power... Can't build\nit without going overboard, they say.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "43": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3c7ec670f6e0b1aee5f212c7df5298c67f50e0258e4d20dce95cf0a93dc64ac7",
      "text": "You might wonder what we're talking\nabout in a situation this dire.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "46": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7747e59b9287aeb2b3b262a7c25a1efd7f4f9114e4d25a53e3f43898047a262a",
      "text": "But please! Lend us your hand...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "50": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6653555332108ca95cd4ea74a46d8ce5294d355079025245bf87423285c9aa05",
      "text": "And three months after construction\nbegan, the finished dragon warship\nset sail. A few days later—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "55": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:610268c058979c8a31e341b4f0f173be7afcca026edec53d317178afbb7760a2",
      "text": "News came in that we had won a\ngreat battle.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "59": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:24dcf96fb43c306c24ae8ac1c6201f91145e1fc234709778c565df889cbd146b",
      "text": "...But it's not like in a movie,\nwhere everything gets solved and\nends.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "62": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:13f8b7ddf645f3f4fe86e6cb12f5f17fc5fc55952cfd043c3928e796458ecf90",
      "text": "Our days go on, even today—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "70": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e2c4a603e0d652abf434a9bbb7da0e5d0a47b69d35d0c6c375f5e4d4f746312d",
      "text": "Hff... Haah...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "73": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:95c00bb20d1ff003f91f1ec5ba3c492ad7a22f2fea666248a4cb20f613b18ee5",
      "text": "Is this all the reconstruction\nmaterial for today? I can still fly\na bit more, though...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "78": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:54c8afc8e8d50778a2d4f31c05184cfb86a234b776d6c22b52cbf50e1990fe96",
      "text": "That's plenty. Thank you, Ms.\nSuminami.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "82": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2c16197e470d6187851bc2a7a8bce8e964d9de4f304d7135204822f7fa0960fe",
      "text": "Amazing, Suminami... It'd take days\nto carry it normally...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "87": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:33320ff774b7063d3253b5ad922345bf1a1ccf093d41f67ef128629bb15a32ec",
      "text": "She was a huge help when we built\nthe ship, too. She carried so many\nmaterials.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "92": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d1bbd2d2511752fe6316a1d67fd1f43a932bef93afd040d49546290237b06d8d",
      "text": "Thanks to her, the reconstruction\nshould finish earlier than first\nestimated. It really helps.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "98": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e46a325781edb1905cd31340d0dd65c1d816ece086b520489a4428c1a9f4ce4c",
      "text": "...No. My power tires me out fast,\nso it's frustrating...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "103": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c6000d59c881c5ebafe8388333d48a396c013d092cb3a2feaaff3ded0f025b20",
      "text": "No, no, resting is part of the job.\nIf you get wrecked like Ayumu,\nthat's seriously bad, you know?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "107": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:29c47b2c90f467ac8dc39ae06bb3583616d6d3607885986d15aa133febf50675",
      "text": "Yeah, that's true, but... I don't\nthink you should say that.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "110": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2fc1663bc45ab568533aa05bbba0fc035b7426f7c90668c6e09e88ba5f9558c8",
      "text": "Suminami, good work! We'll take it\nfrom here. Go rest for today!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "113": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dc267b9b573f00ded655652d47d6c3fa1bff0d2a02f26edbd497e792c85d3808",
      "text": "Oh, no...! I can still work—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "116": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:73defac322d4cf76392f7e41cb6f355e5ab4781d7c27d9d4b17e4214f545f3e0",
      "text": "Let's go, guys! Pump it up!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "118": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a817ffc4da7123ebea79865eb8497f064ac102af6ca3c1a52723f61177a41098",
      "text": "Wooo! Wasshoi!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "120": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:771d5ad8a39691fd0142e355e15caab44ea6b97c8c15a1f76be8ef32e0893b5b",
      "text": "Hey, though, can we put barriers on\nbuildings or something? It wouldn't\nbe funny if they got wrecked again.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:beb24857903152db50a800837df6429919e1defb3777d81891f241a497397a7f",
      "text": "Well, we'll deal with it then. Next\ntime, let's remodel it into a\nsuper-strong Super Shibuya!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "125": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:68fd6c6a70c6fda4f0e5f14e35349e25d365b48aa5280fe8f94688ce2b0d4f9b",
      "text": "...Everyone has their worries,\ndon't they.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "128": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7aa0f07e21f6500b1fcebb0a3afde6b4a6445c0ad4c0c6b7eec600f4a49a7aba",
      "text": "We were barely rebuilding in another\nworld when we got attacked again...\nThey smile now, celebrating, but...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "132": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0a3d62740dbc298a6b02701514f55d01759ace7b372d820712c1883e2b5b6568",
      "text": "...Same as at Magia Fest. They\nsmile to hide their anxiety...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "136": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c7056419dd4567a9938e126da78e297189d35ff8fd454942ae1bcd254e786128",
      "text": "...Yeah. I guess so...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "141": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1d12a9cbf3fb7b20a0fe37ace8b7db36ed738d355d59c5d8c0df4dd8a7445be8",
      "text": "S-sorry...! I don't mean to say\nanything about Mr. Nagihara...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "145": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:971f7f9becbdfa42957fa36590990d30537e6a5118ee6912af4ca3576d797e28",
      "text": "Oh, it's fine, I get it. Actually, I\njust thought, you really are the one\nwho made Binary Planet.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "149": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:69cf602648118e5507dab6624c5a2dc267240d7134da7bbbe88cd0f8824bb0e8",
      "text": "N-no...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "152": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8f4692d2d826dacc7489b6297f0ceb97bafdd74863c6feb6c49d9fa48717a2ca",
      "text": "...Um... ...Mr. Nagihara, is your\nbody okay now?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "156": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1a38d346e36d1d42606c1be18783fb32ef5ecf707769c000d2ad82df60a47ba4",
      "text": "Oh, my body's fine. Only one eye is\ngone. I could actually do heavy\nwork.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "160": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4e6b24f22e8d8ae52e0b28f5b06cc7ad762c59f7fb5b0b59c78e20fdc16afd94",
      "text": "......Do you have regrets?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "165": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b26c907de138632a436d563c19647d3417d3c3c5bb97f1972b1ce0d19dbe3ad8",
      "text": "Yeah. Probably.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "167": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a5f8cc0307a6fc04b3c8a76a9bdfaff3a04835d9b9d3e6170d1907538557bc69",
      "text": "But there are also things I don't\nregret at all, far more than that.\n...Probably?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "171": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:81857ece6039b95550133abeb8f7b91d0479376e30d65d95594d1ef77ce8f158",
      "text": "......I see.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "175": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499",
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "178": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b23ccad9ee9b6dbc067bdbcd76279c358d28521ee11bc1a0af0a9e0d233d7be6",
      "text": "Nao came to see me the other day.\nShe said she wouldn't be around for\na while because of the expedition.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "180": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4eab22de47049683a7727a182d416854407d100203a3378214fefb35ab721d7c",
      "text": "...I thought she was amazing. She\nkeeps moving forward.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "183": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6da94c3d8fb03c230e108b48fbaa56be329789705797bfefa0f640b29edcd289",
      "text": "Mr. Takamori. Mr. Nagihara. I want\nto try harder.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "186": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:67296a2ba5c296aa4271631167d8fc1c8e79aacc735637a804462a7ee4a4484f",
      "text": "I've already been helped. Now I\nwant to help.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "191": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c2e3e1c8f0945704c292e6c52d870a90b50627afd20ce7e4ee0cc75021b80b63",
      "text": "...Yes. But in that case, you may\nhave a different way than Mr.\nNagihara and the others.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "193": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a847a65c1a393da19ecc73eb13116e40a65aec1e90c6b4572e49ff735b53a3a4",
      "text": "Surely Ms. Suminami has a way of\nher own.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "198": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1c9eb81eeaebb1119ec732cf90c35815f1beef4f33a05b602380d64f29cc16f2",
      "text": "My own...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "202": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b9ba28db34e95c4f64fb8500d6eb8a09f120f51e4bf3ce157d6041874b5164cb",
      "text": "I want to make a new song.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "206": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0e211f5f27c00562a2c7d5613e317d89cd69dc4fb4033c116bde2007fe831679",
      "text": "And if I can... I'd like to lighten\neveryone's anxiety, even a little.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "211": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a425cf1577ba938d96c9943efd9dc7c8140c29081db8d2ee22d2b448ae3d1741",
      "text": "Yes. I'm sure you can. That's\nexactly Ms. Suminami's way, isn't\nit?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "216": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c28effa80b1ef8b8ba7cd108fdca1cfbb8c200736fbd69bcce5899b01c08a693",
      "text": "Yes...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "221": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:97b8ff08318b89a15f991820bc88d34fa55a2366109787f4f6f5375aaf7bb4db",
      "text": "Then you will need a studio.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "225": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194",
      "text": "...Huh?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "230": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ee9a86d448271696085d80b8e5e3b92955de8c3faeeb5de7eff122105883bdaf",
      "text": "Huh, huh?! This...! Is it really\nokay?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "234": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1fadc07569212588177b246485334b3c521ad196a51b427a84f05dfea3cbf031",
      "text": "Well... Actually, a certain noble\nstudent council president already\ngot the equipment ready...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "238": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cd549d88f7d356b12f9883e043e7c211248d7caefc818e905c0725c10628a82f",
      "text": "It feels like one step closer to\nbeing fenced in, but... I'll thank\nher later.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "241": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dc14c36da19b907bba84c13d4fbc06fcf7964e3b3e21780d09a5ec4f651d7dd7",
      "text": "And you, Mr. Nagihara, and the\nothers. Thank you very much.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "245": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a15013813efd6c5b58f68df855913cd61555f095b8c29690ee097a4a5d4a8d0c",
      "text": "You're welcome.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "249": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3070e93c2d25fa47d432564801e82727e53910ca86ea1d77470f814c374e8452",
      "text": "I'll probably be coming here even\nmore than before. Thank you\nagain...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "255": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1b15e7591a52b287e9a543911bbb9cc91c33143ba187067765731af531025488",
      "text": "Yes. You are welcome here, Hibiki.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "259": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:de940b995bb1a7d7815577e97df096593d0c7c38c361dc1a5377644f1e307132",
      "text": "My way, for everyone...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "263": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:83264e17da996080b02f71b2b97c156de2b15b40e44fb34a7b46aa7ff5335a64",
      "text": "I'll make a wonderful song—!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
